                                "sense_id": "ebf494e2-1e54-3a41-94c3-7e119c233daf",
                                "text": "And Tom made another loutish salute, and cut the conference short by turning off the path and beginning to hollo after some trespassing cattle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad84a18f-fc3f-4cf3-998c-a1fd61511109",
                                "sense_id": "ebf494e2-1e54-3a41-94c3-7e119c233daf",
                                "text": "Better hollo abstract ideas through the six-foot Alpine horn of prose."
